{"change_summary":"Applied the pending baseline-harness amendments by adding explicit artifact labels to harness runs and metadata, hardening envelope checks so constrained floating-point metrics fail on NaN/Inf, widening scenario nitrate envelopes to preserve qualitative source-water-aware behavior, and splitting shrimp egg bookkeeping so malformed cohorts are repaired only at save-load boundaries while runtime invariants now fail fast on mismatches. Updated the baseline e2e suite to avoid artifact collisions, document the widened NO3 reasoning, replace the synthetic reproduction baseline with a public-startup berried-window fixture plus a clearly labeled controlled-ideal hatch-path test, and made the small scenario/core compile-fix updates needed to keep the affected packages building for targeted validation.","outstanding_risks":["Full `cargo test -p tank_core` validation is still blocked by unrelated unresolved merge-conflict markers in the worktree, notably `crates/tank_core/src/systems/plant_growth.rs`, so only targeted `tank_core` suites were run.","The new public-startup shrimp fixture preserves current v0.1 behavior as a berried-window plus egg-failure baseline; natural juvenile hatching still does not occur under normal mortality/starting-state semantics, so hatch mechanics are only guarded by the separate controlled-ideal test.","The repository remains in a dirty merge state with unrelated `UU` files outside this bead, which increases integration risk until those conflicts are resolved."],"steps":[{"description":"Reviewed the pending amendments against the existing harness, baseline e2e suite, and shrimp invariant/save-load paths to identify the concrete code and test changes needed.", "order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Patched the harness and scenario tests to add artifact labels, finite-value envelope guards, broader source-water-aware NO3 envelopes, and separated public-startup reproduction coverage from the controlled-ideal hatch-path regression.", "order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Moved shrimp egg-cohort repair to load-time normalization, made runtime invariant enforcement reject bookkeeping mismatches, added targeted regression coverage, and applied the small compile-fix updates required for affected packages.", "order":3,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Ran formatting and targeted package/test validation, then recorded the remaining full-package validation blocker caused by unrelated merge-conflict files.", "order":4,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`cargo fmt --all` completed successfully.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test validation` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test save_load` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_scenarios` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_harness --test e2e_baseline_scenarios -- --nocapture` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_harness` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core` could not complete because unrelated unresolved merge markers remain in the worktree, including `crates/tank_core/src/systems/plant_growth.rs`."]}